.* DSPOVR: the file overrides in effect for the job, merged over its
.* call levels; F11 shows each one where it was issued.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 4'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LVLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 5'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=KWDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=LVL CLASS=LVLCL VALUE='*'.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=FILE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=TYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=LEVEL CLASS=LVLCL.
:VAR NAME=KWDS CLASS=KWDCL.
:VAR NAME=MERGED CLASS=LVLCL VALUE='1'.
:LISTDEF NAME=OVRS VARS='OPT FILE TYPE LEVEL KWDS'.
:COND NAME=MERGED EXPR='&MERGED. EQ "1"'.
:COND NAME=ALL EXPR='&MERGED. NE "1"'.
:KEYL NAME=OVKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=MERGED.F11=All file overrides
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11' COND=ALL.F11=Merged file overrides
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOVR KEYL=OVKEYS HELP=DSPOVR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display All Merged File Overrides
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=LVL USAGE=OUTPUT.Call level
.* Not shown: it sets the colon column.
:DATAI VAR=MERGED USAGE=OUTPUT DISPLAY=NO.Call level of overrides
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OVRS VIEWS=2 MAXHEAD=2.(No overrides in effect)
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display override details
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Display contributing file overrides
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:LISTCOL VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=LEVEL USAGE=OUTPUT.Level
:LISTCOL VAR=KWDS USAGE=OUTPUT.Keyword Specifications
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE TYPE KWDS'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='OPT FILE TYPE LEVEL KWDS'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOVRD KEYL=OVKEYS HELP=DSPOVR ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Override Details
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=FILE USAGE=OUTPUT.File
:DATAI VAR=TYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:DATAI VAR=LEVEL USAGE=OUTPUT.Call level
:DATAI VAR=KWDS USAGE=OUTPUT.Keywords
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPOVR.Display Overrides - Help
:P.The overrides that open operations of this job would use now, one
line per file with the keywords that apply, merged over the call
levels. F11 lists every override where it was issued instead; option
5 shows one in full.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
